---
layout: base.njk
title: Essays
---
<section class="intro">
  <p>Monthly essays examining bias in clinical algorithms, the ethics of health data, and how AI systems shape patient outcomes.</p>
</section>

<ul class="essay-list">
  {% for essay in collections.essays %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ essay.url }}">
      <span class="essay-list-title">{{ essay.data.title }}</span>
      <span class="essay-list-date">{{ essay.data.date | readableDate }}</span>
    </a>
    {% if essay.data.description %}<p>{{ essay.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
